      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is the prayer for the French Emperor, Napoleon III, a year before he was captured by the Prussians in the doomed Franco-Prussian War of 1870, as it appears in <tei:hi rend="italic">Seder haThephiloth</tei:hi> (1869), p. 290-293. Hebraization of “Louis Napoleon” included from a painted wooden tablet with prayer for Napoleon III, from the Jungholtz synagogue, ca. 1850 (MAS). (Many thanks to Noam Sienna for this photo.)</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_41305_notes"/>
